                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>5.10  niːmaxaá š¢umáːt ɬíːy (ríːy), ʔakít kwaliːníɬ kštampíːn špuːtamaá tuː ¢u¢uːwamá</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
